[gd_scene format=3]
; Line2D with a normal-mapped CanvasTexture: Vertical runs down the canvas and Turned runs across it,
; rotated a quarter turn. Both carry a flat normal map that tilts to +x. Only the item's basis turns
; the normal (canvas.glsl:708-710), never the line's direction or UVs, so Vertical lights as the
; Polygon2D does and Turned is lit from below. No other scene lights a Line2D through a normal map.

